---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="Privacy policy for Josu's site: no tracking cookies.">
  <section class="wrap max-w-2xl py-16 sm:py-20">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold sm:text-5xl">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted">An honest summary of what data this site touches. Spoiler: almost none.</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-muted">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text">Cookies and tracking</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          This site uses <strong class="text-text">no tracking cookies</strong> and no third-party analytics.
          No trackers, no pixels, no ad profiling.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text">What is stored in your browser</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Only your <strong class="text-text">preferences</strong>, in the browser's local storage
          (<code class="font-mono text-sm">localStorage</code>) and never sent to any server:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
          <li>the <strong class="text-text">theme</strong> (light or dark),</li>
          <li>your chosen <strong class="text-text">language</strong>,</li>
          <li>whether you already dismissed this privacy notice.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">You can clear these at any time by clearing the site's data in your browser.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text">Hosting</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The site is served as static pages from <strong class="text-text">GitHub Pages</strong>, which, like
          any web server, may log technical access data (IP address, user-agent) in its own logs. That is outside
          this site's control and governed by GitHub's policy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text">External links and fonts</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Links to GitHub, LinkedIn and HackTheBox take you to their sites, each with its own policy.
          Fonts are loaded from <strong class="text-text">Google Fonts</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Questions? Email me at <code class="font-mono text-sm text-text">{site.email}</code>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
